defklown wrote:
> Are you less likely to successfully wish for armor or a weapon if you
> wish for it to be blessed, greased, fixed, or enchanted?

Fixed, blessed, greased all come for free.

enchantments don't affect whether or not you'll get the wish, but the
actual enchantment value you receive is based off a percentage:

enchantment / percentage / average enchantment
+1   100%   1
+2   80%    1.6
+3   60%    1.8
+4   40%    1.6

so, generally speaking, +3 is the best enchantment to wish for.

see the full wishing spoiler here:

http://nh.gmuf.com/wish.html

